 4}, {"beat": 172, "note": 38, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 208, "note": 36, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 212, "note": 36, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 216, "note": 38, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 220, "note": 38, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 224, "note": 36, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 228, "note": 36, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 232, "note": 38, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 236, "note": 38, "duration": 4}]}, "toplines": {"type": "notes", "channel": 10, "notes": [{"beat": 16, "note": 58, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 96, "note": 58, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 176, "note": 58, "duration": 4}]}, "voix": {"type": "notes", "channel": 13, "notes": [{"beat": 0, "note": 55, "duration": 4}]}, "lyrics": {"type": "lyrics", "lyrics": [{"beat": 0, "text": ""}, {"beat": 4, "text": "[intro]"}, {"beat": 36, "text": "Je suis pas l\u00e0 pour faire des prouesses,"}, {"beat": 44, "text": "Les grands solos, \u00e7a me laisse perplexe."}, {"beat": 52, "text": "Je pr\u00e9f\u00e8re des blagues et des grimaces,"}, {"beat": 60, "text": "Faire rire les gens, c'est ma meilleure classe."}, {"beat": 68, "text": "Je suis un(e) artiste farfelu(e),"}, {"beat": 76, "text": "La virtuosit\u00e9 m'a jamais int\u00e9ress\u00e9(e) du tout."}, {"beat": 84, "text": "Je pr\u00e9f\u00e8re m'amuser, \u00eatre un peu fou/folle,"}, {"beat": 92, "text": "Ma petite folie, c'est \u00e7a qui me rend si cool."}, {"beat": 100, "text": "[ \u2026 ]"}, {"beat": 116, "text": "Quand je chante, c'est toujours d\u00e9jant\u00e9,"}, {"beat": 124, "text": "Les paroles s\u00e9rieuses, \u00e7a m'a jamais int\u00e9ress\u00e9."}, {"beat": 132, "text": "Je pr\u00e9f\u00e8re des mots qui font sourire,"}, {"beat": 140, "text": "Faire danser les foules, les faire partir."}, {"beat": 148, "text": "Je suis un(e) artiste farfelu(e),"}, {"beat": 156, "text": "La virtuosit\u00e9 m'a jamais int\u00e9ress\u00e9(e) du tout."}, {"beat": 164, "text": "Je pr\u00e9f\u00e8re m'amuser, \u00eatre un peu fou/folle,"}, {"beat": 172, "text": "Ma petite folie, c'est \u00e7a qui me rend si cool."}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "Alors rejoignez-moi dans cette danse d\u00e9cal\u00e9e,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Oublions les conventions, soyons d\u00e9jant\u00e9s."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Car la musique, c'est avant tout du plaisir,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "Et ma petite folie, c'est \u00e7a qui nous fait fr\u00e9mir."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}